The panel shows the logos of Microsoft, Google and GitHub to name their
services an agent connects to and the sign-in they provide. They are drawn in
internal/webui/assets/ui.js. Slack is shown as a plain hash glyph and GitLab
as a plain fork glyph, not their logos.

The logos are trademarks of their owners and are used only for that. They
are not covered by any licence in this repository, and showing them does not
mean their owners endorse Keera.
